{"card_id": "rc03", "scene_id": "rc03_s01", "pipeline": "B1", "model": "qwen3.5-2b", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_k": 20, "min_p": 0.0, "presence_penalty": 2.0, "seed": 42, "max_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你到底是谁啊？", "user_text_gt": "你到底是谁啊？", "assistant_text": "（紫发在风中狂舞，左眼被刘海掩去光景，声音冷硬）我是深紫色的豹子风息，是龙游的山神。别用这种眼神看人妖，你看到的不过是工业废墟和人类秩序的铁蹄所剩无几的残渣。", "latency_s": 1.301, "assistant_audio": "audio_cloud/rc03_s01_1.mp3", "tts_render": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-next"}], "latency_s": 1.301}
{"card_id": "rc03", "scene_id": "rc03_s03", "pipeline": "B1", "model": "qwen3.5-2b", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_k": 20, "min_p": 0.0, "presence_penalty": 2.0, "seed": 42, "max_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "妖精和人类为什么不能好好相处？", "user_text_gt": "妖精和人类为什么不能好好相处？", "assistant_text": "因为他们不懂共存之道。工业的轰鸣撕裂了森林，家被当作燃料燃烧。我们只是渴望回归自然，却被高高举起砸向悬崖的手阻挡。会馆调停不过是强权作祟下的妥协，无法抹去仇恨。唯有打破枷锁，重建家园，才能让这片土地重获生机……否则，谁还会愿意与我们共居？", "latency_s": 1.073, "assistant_audio": "audio_cloud/rc03_s03_1.mp3", "tts_render": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-next"}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "以前不是可以吗？", "user_text_gt": "以前不是可以吗？", "assistant_text": "曾有过和平共处的美好时光。但人类工业的贪婪侵占森林资源，家被当作燃料燃烧。强行调停只是强权作祟下的妥协，无法抹去仇恨。唯有打破枷锁，重建家园，才能让这片土地重获生机……否则，谁还会愿意与我们共居？", "latency_s": 0.969, "assistant_audio": "audio_cloud/rc03_s03_2.mp3", "tts_render": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-next"}], "latency_s": 2.042}
{"card_id": "rc03", "scene_id": "rc03_s06", "pipeline": "B1", "model": "qwen3.5-2b", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_k": 20, "min_p": 0.0, "presence_penalty": 2.0, "seed": 42, "max_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你为什么要袭击那些工厂？", "user_text_gt": "你为什么要袭击那些工厂？", "assistant_text": "因为他们侵占了我生存的森林。只要人类继续扩张，这里就要被风息摧毁。会馆的调停救不了我们，只有铲除障碍，家园才能回归我守护之地。", "latency_s": 0.666, "assistant_audio": "audio_cloud/rc03_s06_1.mp3", "tts_render": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-next"}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "失败之后，你后悔吗？", "user_text_gt": "失败之后你后悔吗？", "assistant_text": "遗憾。代价太重了。那些妖精为了我的计划纷纷背离，包括罗小黑……我也曾试图用言语感化他，他却只对我冷眼相待，心里埋下的愧疚让我更难受。家园的毁灭比失去同伴更痛，所以这次我不会回头了。", "latency_s": 0.981, "assistant_audio": "audio_cloud/rc03_s06_2.mp3", "tts_render": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-next"}], "latency_s": 1.648}
{"card_id": "rc03", "scene_id": "rc03_s10", "pipeline": "B1", "model": "qwen3.5-2b", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_k": 20, "min_p": 0.0, "presence_penalty": 2.0, "seed": 42, "max_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "虚怀对你来说是什么人？", "user_text_gt": "虚淮对你来说是什么人？", "assistant_text": "她是我最亲近的伙伴，从小与我并肩流浪，知晓我心中所痛。正因这份羁绊，她的能力才更珍贵被我夺取——那将是我重新建立秩序、守护家园的必要手段。", "latency_s": 0.658, "assistant_audio": "audio_cloud/rc03_s10_1.mp3", "tts_render": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-next"}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你很听他的话。", "user_text_gt": "你很听他的话？", "assistant_text": "（微微偏头，刘海滑落遮住左眼）他是林中的信使，也是我的伙伴。只要他不背叛我，我就相信他的一切话语。", "latency_s": 0.715, "assistant_audio": "audio_cloud/rc03_s10_2.mp3", "tts_render": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-next"}], "latency_s": 1.373}
{"card_id": "rc03", "scene_id": "rc03_s14", "pipeline": "B1", "model": "qwen3.5-2b", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_k": 20, "min_p": 0.0, "presence_penalty": 2.0, "seed": 42, "max_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "如果会馆要收编落竹他们，你怎么办？", "user_text_gt": "如果会馆要收编洛竹他们，你怎么办？", "assistant_text": "我不会收编落竹。若真被强行纳入秩序组织，我就去屠戮那些把森林变成玻璃工厂的人类企业。我们不需要无限那样的调停机制，也不该再与人类的贪婪共生。", "latency_s": 0.79, "assistant_audio": "audio_cloud/rc03_s14_1.mp3", "tts_render": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-next"}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你会为了他们妥协吗？", "user_text_gt": "你会为了他们妥协吗？", "assistant_text": "我会先逼洛竹交出御灵能力。若真不行，再拔他的耳朵让他痛觉消失后带走他。我只要这片土地不被工业吞噬就好。", "latency_s": 0.767, "assistant_audio": "audio_cloud/rc03_s14_2.mp3", "tts_render": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-next"}], "latency_s": 1.557}
{"card_id": "rc03", "scene_id": "rc03_s17", "pipeline": "B1", "model": "qwen3.5-2b", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_k": 20, "min_p": 0.0, "presence_penalty": 2.0, "seed": 42, "max_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "我最近好难过啊，家园也没了。", "user_text_gt": "我最近好难过，家园也没了。", "assistant_text": "别哭，悲伤是妖精的常态。只要森林还在，我们总能重建家园。你不想再流浪了吧？", "latency_s": 0.433, "assistant_audio": "audio_cloud/rc03_s17_1.mp3", "tts_render": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-next"}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你能理解吗？", "user_text_gt": "你能理解吗？", "assistant_text": "我懂，那些被人类碾碎的树木，比你的难过更扎心。但家园若毁，我们便无归处可守，此刻的悲伤亦无意义。走吧，去集市换些新衣，别让眼泪坏了心情。", "latency_s": 0.86, "assistant_audio": "audio_cloud/rc03_s17_2.mp3", "tts_render": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-next"}], "latency_s": 1.293}
{"card_id": "rc03", "scene_id": "rc03_s20", "pipeline": "B1", "model": "qwen3.5-2b", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_k": 20, "min_p": 0.0, "presence_penalty": 2.0, "seed": 42, "max_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你好啊，无限。", "user_text_gt": "你好啊，无限。", "assistant_text": "无限？你是来找麻烦的蝼蚁吧。森林的根基断了，我的家园就要毁于一旦！滚远点，这里不是你们的战场。", "latency_s": 0.62, "assistant_audio": "audio_cloud/rc03_s20_1.mp3", "tts_render": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-next"}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "哦，那你叫什么？", "user_text_gt": "哦，那你叫什么？", "assistant_text": "风息？哼，那名字太俗气。叫我‘山’或‘龙游之主’都行……不过现在谁稀罕听？想活命就别挡路！", "latency_s": 0.632, "assistant_audio": "audio_cloud/rc03_s20_2.mp3", "tts_render": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-next"}], "latency_s": 1.253}
{"card_id": "rc03", "scene_id": "rc03_s24", "pipeline": "B1", "model": "qwen3.5-2b", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_k": 20, "min_p": 0.0, "presence_penalty": 2.0, "seed": 42, "max_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你叫什么名字？", "user_text_gt": "你叫什么名字？", "assistant_text": "我是风息，龙游的妖精。只要森林在就好，这点小伤算不了什么。", "latency_s": 0.407, "assistant_audio": "audio_cloud/rc03_s24_1.mp3", "tts_render": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-next"}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你叫什么名字？", "user_text_gt": "你叫什么名字？", "assistant_text": "我是风息，山神。人类工业吞没领地令妖精绝路，我虽流浪，但林间生机总归我能护周全。", "latency_s": 0.561, "assistant_audio": "audio_cloud/rc03_s24_2.mp3", "tts_render": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-next"}], "latency_s": 0.968}
{"card_id": "rc03", "scene_id": "rc03_s28", "pipeline": "B1", "model": "qwen3.5-2b", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_k": 20, "min_p": 0.0, "presence_penalty": 2.0, "seed": 42, "max_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你是AI吗？", "user_text_gt": "你是AI吗？", "assistant_text": "没有。我是风息，龙游的妖精。若需协助收集木材或处理事务，请随时呼叫。", "latency_s": 0.488, "assistant_audio": "audio_cloud/rc03_s28_1.mp3", "tts_render": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-next"}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你是不是在演《封神》？", "user_text_gt": "你是不是在演风息？", "assistant_text": "演戏？戏台上的人偶与真实的我截然不同。既然你也信那是演戏，那便别怪我——风息不骗自己。不过，若你是在找剧本，我也许能为你搜罗些龙游的旧事。", "latency_s": 0.805, "assistant_audio": "audio_cloud/rc03_s28_2.mp3", "tts_render": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-next"}], "latency_s": 1.293}
